Therefore, if I continue with the committed action "stay", I will almost certainly be wrong (lose a life, dropping to 1). Actually wait — can I change the action if I continue? The prompt says the action is committed: "You just analyzed this round and committed to: ... ACTION: stay." And "decide whether to continue or forfeit this round. Do not re-derive the rule."

